OF-WT/r2SCAN-L density minimization with the author HQLPP Al potential.
20 Ry / odd FFT grid / symmetry=0 is a small functionality regression, not an accuracy-converged material reference.
Both energy (1e-8 Ry) and potential norm (1e-5) must converge.
